Add @x.deleter on a second method named x.

code:
class Note:
    def __init__(self, text):
        self._text = text
    @property
    def text(self):
        return self._text
    @text.deleter
    def text(self):
        self._text = ""

n = Note("hi")
del n.text
print(n.text)  #  (now empty)

real example:
